<title>QATAR: Qatar Cement Co 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Qatar Cement Co 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				   (million Qatar riyals)</p>
<p>				     1996	    1995</p>
<p>Net profit			 63.2	    58.6</p>
<p>Total revenue		   109.3	    98.5</p>
<p>Other income		     20.4	    22.3</p>
<p>Total expenses		   66.5	    61.1</p>
<p>Dividends			  16.2	    13.0</p>
<p>Full Name: Qatar National Cement Company Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE: QNCC on Sunday distributed 25 percent dividend to its shareholders. It is 43 percent owned by the state and 57 percent by Qatari citizens.</p>
</text>
